{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"1ade1e209f80afbb5933f5af53413a241c7608c72a90d254b37ffaaffc8a9468","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"af41a12055ca8247631fd934b1be83c07ed6770a35fbee844b2e326675e5bad9","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"0090a2e8672e93060276814c3052d003ade90bd38529329a54c65f6472f2ee83","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"Newline invariant broken: the source (world-artifacts.lua:5528-5530, commit 624a6732) has a blank line (\\n\\n) between \"...for a stolen sword.\" and \"His last known words were...\", but the target joins 「…复仇。他留下的最后遗言是…」 directly with no newline, so the paragraph break is lost."},{"revision_key":"0a4c89e965bb89255f390021ec6ea94917118dcac9a4ed1e0a0a2314ba33a7b9","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"Fidelity: in the source (warrior.lua:116) the second half reads \"rarely leaving the cover of her many protective techniques\", meaning the Bulwark seldom leaves the cover of her many protective techniques. The target 「并拥有极高的防御技能」 drops \"rarely leaving the cover\" and changes \"many techniques\" into \"extremely high defensive skill\", so the meaning has drifted. Suggest something closer to 「很少离开其诸多防护技巧的庇护」."}]}